AmigaOS: wxNavigationEnabled<wxWindow>'s constructor in this file

With toolkit 1c4e5dd, GCC 16 at -O3 leaves RealtimeEffectPanel.o calling
wxNavigationEnabled<wxWindow>::wxNavigationEnabled() without emitting it,
and the link fails. An explicit instantiation here gives it a definition.

--- a/src/RealtimeEffectPanel.cpp
+++ b/src/RealtimeEffectPanel.cpp
@@ -1681,3 +1681,9 @@
    else
       evt.Skip();
 }
+
+#ifdef __AMIGA__
+// the link needs this constructor defined somewhere (GCC 16 -O3, toolkit
+// 1c4e5dd); an explicit instantiation defines the class's members here
+template class wxNavigationEnabled<wxWindow>;
+#endif
